# Init-only smoke for LHLXW. The app's main_process is an internal
# while(1) loop that polls firmware globals (act_info / isCheckAction)
# instead of returning each tick, so we can't drive it the usual way —
# the second main_process(UNKNOWN) tick the harness normally fires
# would hang here. `init_only` skips that tick.
#
# What we still cover: link, app icon, LHLXW_init, the 2.5 s startLog
# boot animation (which drives lv_task_handler internally) all run
# without crashing. The app icon name returned by AppController is
# what the screenshot will capture.

app LHLXW
init_only

wait_ms 200
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash
